{% comment %}
  ============================================================
  Section: Insurance Checkup
  File:    sections/hero-form.liquid
  ============================================================
  Customer data storage (visible in Shopify Admin):
    • Name / Email / Phone  → Customers → [record] → Overview
    • Tags                  → Customers → [record] → Tags chip
    • Note                  → Customers → [record] → Notes panel
                              Contains appointment date + time
  ============================================================
  Success detection strategy (dual-layer):
    1. sessionStorage flag — set on submit, read on next page load.
       Shopify redirects to the clean return_to URL on success and
       back to the page with #ic-form-- hash on error. The hash
       presence tells us which case it is.
    2. form.posted_successfully? inline <script> — fires if Shopify's
       Liquid flash happens to be set (backup, not always reliable).
  ============================================================
{% endcomment %}

